801fe12fcb9134","logical_entry_identity":"ab7b4bdb63c56e547ec33830962b639ff2aa206cb571bfcbd601da2416793faf","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You \"gently\" slam your saws into the wounds of a creature, dealing %d%% weapon damage and deepening the wounds.\n\t\tAll bleeding wounds durations are increased by %d turns and the damage by %d%% (this may be done only once per bleeding effect).\n\t\tWhen this happens a gush of blood is projected in a narrow cone of radius 4, dealing %0.2f physical damage to all creatures.\n\t\tThe power and damage improves with your Steampower.\n\t\t#{italic}#The marvels of technology, now at the service of true butchery!#{normal}#","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你 \" 轻柔 \" 地将链锯放在目标的伤口上，造成 %d%% 武器伤害并加深伤口。\n\t\t所有流血伤口持续时间增加 %d 回合，伤害增加 %d%% （每项流血最多触发一次）。\n\t\t效果触发时，血流将喷射而出，对 4 码锥形范围内所有生物造成 %0.2f 物理伤害。\n\t\t伤害受蒸汽强度加成。\n\t\t#{italic}#一切技术，皆为屠杀 !#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bd5d36f85422802568683fa866ee3d42ad5793f06783287893f4521c52997bd2","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"1beeb588c2458347118a396edee098cc9e6538422fb8d69aaf62625e22e84c27","logical_entry_identity":"fd12afb0077180eb97a2a4c9d531a89607991f59aa003ee09fcd9c5d0dd15ac8","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#{bold}#%s's tinker attains critical power!#{normal}#","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"#{bold}#%s的蒸汽工具造成了致命一击！#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6f9eb95380b300f9c28130ba3ba1bda816bb47fd4fa38064f649f30d1f7a0913","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"1bf24288e0373a17a7a288d0b64aeb2ebc7bc0676575186908cfb02ec949c1d1","logical_entry_identity":"32cdbcb0e9fbe880b147abad015bb50547e928b9ff8c4dbb116aa653b2bc8149","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Grenade Launcher","source_tag":"talent name","target":"榴弹发射器"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"06445149eec6864ffdda6ce48eca103061174f12b5f4857da6415e0c892695fd","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"1c07925de7dc3b6da37d05e79a7467e1e5ba6aceb22b771a7c338bee3e6370c0","logical_entry_identity":"0547d040ea2c8bb7c5d04937b18290e19d8646a6d55632a81c5235ce9c4abb87","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"worn leather hat","source_tag":"_t","target":"破损的皮帽"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"63760eff5aa82bfadeba878fa56753b73b2697ff8233b047a9e520479fa1ccbf","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"1c3aaf948b59b6b021fb55d7d41e060fd6ac53025c5128cf3c8afb975eafa507","logical_entry_identity":"f6f723e3b2e48e857a9d01281fbe5cedcbf6c91f51ea70a75ecf1d643b73aef1","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"While normally wielding a steamgun loaded with experimental ammunition and an electrically charged shield, they can equip heavy weapons such as flamethrowers.","source_tag":"_t","target":"他们通常装备着装载着实验性弹药的蒸汽枪和一面电力充能的盾牌，但他们也可以装备像火焰喷射器那样的重装武器。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0aeea7335a42957e436afdfff5d8d2c16ccd6623bfbb4e428dfac1ea23776818","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"1c4d4b2948a9942b1c2f9cce848e371fb57b730145ca0d4530cb22f5c0874b06","logical_entry_identity":"660728f2fdc541d437d4d391e6fd0c6e5695e4d508a3edc3a4136ca77bbde0d6","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#Target# tweaks some of %s bullets.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"#Target#调整了%s弹药。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"05abf427a0cf9c343f55ef9e778acadc34c921ddb97f46f7e8d60de09da4ffcc","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"1c84fcbba5fad842881638608e0f4553bff7a1db316edb60f43b7ff13330a7b1","logical_entry_identity":"bd024fc77aa432906640ad4399caa7e39bb43b5d6a1cc6d70e86343261edce72","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You reach out through the aether to all creatures in sight that were slowed by Reality Breach or Congeal Time.\n\t\tFor each target you create a link of arcane infused steam to it that lasts %d turns.\n\t\tAny time the target uses a talent one of your cooling down spells is reduced by 1 (prioritizing Technomancy spells).\n\t\tEach turn the link is up the target and any creature inside the link takes %0.2f occult damage.\n\t\tAs long as at least one link is up, the cooldown of your Metaphasic Spin spell is set to 6 turns instead of 30.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你通过以太触及视野内所有被现实切裂或时间凝固减速的生物。\n\t\t你会为每个目标建立一条注入奥术能量的蒸汽链接，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t每当目标使用技能时，你一个正在冷却的法术便会减少 1 回合冷却时间（优先选择科技法术）。\n\t\t链接存在期间，每回合目标和链接线上的所有生物都会受到 %0.2f 玄机伤害。\n\t\t只要至少有一条链接存在，相位旋转的冷却时间就会设为 6 回合，而非 30 回合。\n\t\t伤害随法术强度提高。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"70d16d6416593ba07dbd0ff506a7793fcb90952ac2df889bd0c1fcd35849c5b5","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"1ca7e07aaf7f1c8769319b599dfa8c9f930a738da9b298974313e93c14312b29","logical_entry_identity":"c076c83a05a6e6620465998af2971ccd1d1e3353467bf34ad49d374e775e5e21","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"chemistry","source_tag":"talent type","target":"化学"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"38a1ac3d754412aaef1161a5c9bae6dbaa542a2f085be99982ba2cb5796129ea","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"1cc19e1a0ab1322c58f0a788a168c51e37f05fbd25fb5adf83c8389899f4f959","logical_entry_identity":"471ef9aa8792475ff049571792aa13edfe694ab96987e34b701a0c9a1ba7a17e","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"50% chance to reload 1 ammo","source_tag":"_t","target":"50% 几率装填1发弹药"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f44d1ab410697589f6396bbc2229ec800706a9d56fdcc2e0122e64eb16d34a71","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"1cc5e564b747b83281a361e41f60f244c54cade83ce6f9644383d722cb4f5caa","logical_entry_identity":"4be0b71fd846e67de78041f18bddba5e40bdb2df9e2c2de9749ecc42243743d0","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You swap your bullets for more massive ones for %d turns.\n\t\tWhen striking a creature, these bullets have a %d%% chance of knocking it back 3 tiles and a %d%% chance of stunning it for 3 turns.\n\t\tThe chances to knockback and stun increase with your Steampower.\n\t\tOnly one bullet enhancement can be used at once.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"为了提高子弹的冲击力，换用了巨型子弹。\n\t\t接下来的 %d 回合内，你的子弹击中时有 %d%% 概率击退目标 3 码，同时有 %d%% 概率震慑目标 3 回合。\n\t\t击退和震慑概率受蒸汽强度影响。\n\t\t一次只能使用一种弹药强化能力。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"snapshot:c49975dd444a5402e37267005027ab2c54e23745a37836d31fd27fd808ee7484","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"66da49fcce23e27b95027c5aa51dc41afc9211cbc227c05fd9cfa8413ec4d2aa"}}